#~ msgid "Yes. Open a thread, press Generate draft reply, and a suggested draft appears in Aziru for you to read and edit. Nothing is ever sent for you: when you are happy with it, you can jump to the thread in Gmail with one click and paste your reply there to send. Each subscription includes a monthly draft allowance."
